{
    "_notes": "Bela Trill Square - 2D capacitive touch, 30 channels, up to 4 simultaneous touches. CENTROID mode returns 4 vertical loc+size pairs followed by 4 horizontal loc+size pairs. Address jumper-configurable 0x28-0x2F.",
